WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.250
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.520 --> 03:09.560
The doctor said…

3
03:09.640 --> 03:10.440
PREVIOUSLY

4
03:10.520 --> 03:11.840
…you lost the baby.

5
03:12.800 --> 03:15.160
-Blood… -I want to take care of you, Father.

6
03:15.800 --> 03:16.920
And take care of my daughter.

7
03:17.520 --> 03:19.480
Please give me one more chance.

8
03:19.560 --> 03:21.040
-Enough, Dad. -Step closer and I'll shoot.

9
03:25.760 --> 03:28.680
Aren't you happy to see me?

10
03:30.080 --> 03:32.800
I even brought your favorite fruit.

11
03:43.600 --> 03:45.120
I'll peel some for you.

12
03:46.520 --> 03:47.360
Nuch.

13
03:48.520 --> 03:49.520
I'm sorry.

14
03:50.640 --> 03:52.840
I never meant to hurt you.

15
03:53.800 --> 03:55.240
You didn't mean to?

16
03:57.560 --> 03:59.800
You were pointing a gun at me.

17
04:00.960 --> 04:02.840
If Papang hadn't stopped you,

18
04:02.920 --> 04:04.760
I could've been shot.

19
04:09.120 --> 04:10.480
I was wrong.

20
04:11.640 --> 04:13.120
I take full responsibility.

21
04:15.200 --> 04:17.279
I'm going to change.

22
04:17.360 --> 04:19.320
Once I leave the hospital,

23
04:20.000 --> 04:22.880
I'll turn myself in and face the consequences.

24
04:24.760 --> 04:28.280
I'm sorry. Give me a chance to take care of you and our son.

25
04:29.960 --> 04:32.520
Someone like you is going to accept responsibility?

26
04:34.480 --> 04:37.120
You're selfish.

27
04:38.680 --> 04:40.800
All this nice talk,

28
04:40.880 --> 04:42.880
all these good deeds,

29
04:43.520 --> 04:45.640
you're just doing it for my forgiveness.

30
04:47.520 --> 04:49.120
Someone like you

31
04:50.160 --> 04:51.600
-deserves to die by my hand. -Hey!

32
04:51.680 --> 04:53.760
-I'll kill you. -Stop, Nuch! Calm down.

33
04:55.160 --> 04:57.640
Nuch, I'm sorry.

34
04:57.720 --> 04:59.640
I want to take care of our son.

35
04:59.720 --> 05:01.680
Please give me a chance.

36
05:02.280 --> 05:03.840
It's too late.

37
05:05.320 --> 05:08.240
My son deserves to grow up in a decent society.

38
05:09.040 --> 05:11.320
He shouldn't know his father is a corrupt man

39
05:11.400 --> 05:12.960
who cheats other people.

40
05:13.680 --> 05:14.520
Nuch.

41
05:15.080 --> 05:18.240
Think carefully. If you kill me,

42
05:18.320 --> 05:19.680
you'll be punished.

43
05:21.120 --> 05:23.640
Then what happens to our son? Who will take care of him?

44
05:23.720 --> 05:26.280
Ramil and Hathaya.

45
05:27.080 --> 05:29.880
They can take care of my son.

46
05:31.760 --> 05:35.160
I'm willing to risk my life for this.

47
05:39.240 --> 05:41.920
My son deserves a good life.

48
05:42.840 --> 05:44.480
He doesn't need a bad father like you.

49
05:46.640 --> 05:49.160
Someone like you deserves to die.

50
05:49.240 --> 05:50.440
Mommy!

51
05:54.080 --> 05:55.800
Mommy, don't hurt Daddy.

52
05:57.200 --> 05:59.040
This terrible man

53
06:00.120 --> 06:01.720
is not your father.

54
06:01.800 --> 06:04.560
Daddy Raiwin is my father.

55
06:13.520 --> 06:16.360
A giant monster got inside Daddy and made him hurt Mommy.

56
06:16.440 --> 06:18.600
Daddy Ramil already killed the monster.

57
06:18.680 --> 06:22.400
Daddy Raiwin is hurt now. I want to help him get better.

58
06:23.360 --> 06:24.920
Aunt Hathaya.

59
06:25.720 --> 06:27.960
The bad giant got inside Mommy too.

60
06:28.040 --> 06:30.200
Please kill the giant.

61
06:34.520 --> 06:35.720
I think

62
06:36.240 --> 06:38.840
the two of you have hurt each other enough.

63
06:40.640 --> 06:42.160
Please stop.

64
06:46.440 --> 06:48.000
Daddy Raiwin.

65
06:49.120 --> 06:50.760
You won't hurt anymore.

66
06:51.480 --> 06:53.280
I have magic medicine.

67
06:53.360 --> 06:55.760
I'm going to make you better.

68
07:00.560 --> 07:02.440
Papang, my son.

69
07:05.960 --> 07:07.320
I'm sorry.

70
07:27.880 --> 07:29.360
I love you.

71
07:32.240 --> 07:35.160
I'm sorry. I really lost control.

72
07:37.040 --> 07:38.920
It's not too late.

73
07:39.000 --> 07:41.160
Your son's love can help heal you.

74
07:43.280 --> 07:46.600
I think I need to move forward with my life.

75
07:46.680 --> 07:49.600
I'm going to find work in another province.

76
07:49.680 --> 07:53.040
Once I've saved enough money, I'll come back and live with my son.

77
07:54.960 --> 07:58.000
Please take care of Papang for me.

78
07:59.360 --> 08:02.840
You don't have to worry. You know Hathaya and I

79
08:02.920 --> 08:04.320
love Papang like our own son.

80
08:05.400 --> 08:08.360
Everyone has been through terrible things.

81
08:08.440 --> 08:10.360
I'm rooting for you.

82
08:10.440 --> 08:12.240
I believe that one day,

83
08:12.320 --> 08:14.880
you'll be strong enough to stand tall again

84
08:14.960 --> 08:16.720
to protect your son

85
08:16.800 --> 08:19.480
and to give love to people who need it.

86
08:20.560 --> 08:22.120
Thank you.

87
08:24.760 --> 08:27.960
Can I hug you goodbye?

88
08:42.360 --> 08:44.480
Be careful. She's dangerous.

89
09:01.160 --> 09:02.800
What did Nuchwara say to you?

90
09:04.120 --> 09:04.960
You want to know?

91
09:09.840 --> 09:10.920
I'm not telling you.

92
09:23.560 --> 09:25.080
Saksit called.

93
09:25.160 --> 09:27.720
He said Raiwin tricked him into meeting Ramil

94
09:27.800 --> 09:31.120
because he's planning to turn himself in. Saksit shot Raiwin and then ran.

95
09:31.200 --> 09:33.200
How heartless can someone be?

96
09:33.280 --> 09:35.480
A father willing to kill his own son.

97
09:36.080 --> 09:37.840
If he betrays me,

98
09:38.360 --> 09:39.800
I won't let him get away with it.

99
09:40.600 --> 09:43.160
And what if it were me? What would you do then?

100
09:51.400 --> 09:53.520
Just don't betray me, Mom.

101
09:55.480 --> 09:56.400
So…

102
09:57.320 --> 09:59.520
what do we do now?

103
10:01.560 --> 10:03.200
I'll use the same plan.

104
10:03.880 --> 10:05.880
I'll trick Saksit into helping us escape.

105
10:06.480 --> 10:08.240
I don't trust him.

106
10:08.320 --> 10:11.880
If he finds out we don't have any money, he'll kill us.

107
10:11.960 --> 10:13.480
I already told you.

108
10:14.160 --> 10:16.440
I have nothing left to lose.

109
10:16.520 --> 10:19.520
Saksit is the only person who can get us out.

110
10:29.560 --> 10:30.840
Chamoi.

111
10:32.440 --> 10:33.480
Chamoi.

112
10:35.440 --> 10:36.480
It's me.

113
10:38.160 --> 10:39.560
Chamoi.

114
10:40.400 --> 10:41.400
Chamoi.

115
10:43.400 --> 10:44.360
Oh my God!

116
10:45.040 --> 10:48.800
Mom, I ordered food.

117
10:50.440 --> 10:51.640
Mom?

118
10:55.240 --> 10:56.560
Where did you go?

119
11:00.600 --> 11:01.800
Why did you call me?

120
11:02.880 --> 11:05.440
Chamoi, open the gate.

121
11:05.520 --> 11:06.800
I need to see Father.

122
11:06.880 --> 11:09.920
No. You tried to hurt him.

123
11:10.760 --> 11:12.840
I need to talk to him.

124
11:13.680 --> 11:15.440
I admit I was wrong.

125
11:15.520 --> 11:17.640
Please. Open the gate and let me see Father.

126
11:17.720 --> 11:21.040
No. You've done too many terrible things.

127
11:21.760 --> 11:24.640
I'm never letting you set foot in this house again.

128
11:24.720 --> 11:26.240
I'm calling the police.

129
11:26.320 --> 11:29.200
Chamoi, please.

130
11:29.280 --> 11:31.640
Don't call them yet. Let me see Father first.

131
11:32.360 --> 11:35.600
Open the gate. Please let me in. I'm scared.

132
11:36.800 --> 11:39.760
Now you're scared? When you were doing all those terrible things,

133
11:39.840 --> 11:41.320
why weren't you scared then?

134
11:41.400 --> 11:43.880
Then what do I have to do

135
11:44.400 --> 11:45.960
before you'll let me in?

136
11:46.880 --> 11:48.600
Get down on your knees.

137
11:48.680 --> 11:50.640
Get down on your knees and beg me.

138
11:50.720 --> 11:53.080
Then I'll open the gate.

139
12:13.080 --> 12:16.520
Chamoi, I beg you.

140
12:16.600 --> 12:19.360
Now please let me in so I can talk to Father.

141
12:20.040 --> 12:23.320
All right. I'll let you in.

142
12:29.080 --> 12:31.440
Pong! You're still alive? Let go of me!

143
12:31.520 --> 12:32.480
-Hey! -Help!

144
12:32.560 --> 12:33.560
My god!

145
12:33.640 --> 12:34.840
Someone help!

146
12:34.920 --> 12:36.400
Chamoi.

147
12:36.480 --> 12:38.120
-What happened? -Madam.

148
12:38.200 --> 12:40.800
Pong kidnapped Madam Liu.

149
12:40.880 --> 12:42.040
Pong?

150
12:42.120 --> 12:43.800
Chamoi, call the police.

151
12:43.880 --> 12:45.000
Quickly.

152
12:46.040 --> 12:47.880
Where are you going?

153
12:47.960 --> 12:49.440
To get the car and follow them.

154
12:49.520 --> 12:50.760
-Hurry. -Okay.

155
12:51.640 --> 12:54.240
-Come here, you bitch. -Pong.

156
12:54.320 --> 12:55.480
-Let go. -Go.

157
12:59.080 --> 13:00.720
How did you survive?

158
13:00.800 --> 13:02.840
I survived to teach you something.

159
13:03.440 --> 13:05.360
When you try to kill someone,

160
13:05.440 --> 13:07.200
you'd better make sure they're dead.

161
13:07.720 --> 13:10.720
-Otherwise, they'll come back to kill you. -Don't.

162
13:10.800 --> 13:13.400
Just like I'm about to do now.

163
13:13.480 --> 13:14.440
No.

164
13:15.520 --> 13:16.800
Come here.

165
13:20.240 --> 13:21.320
Come here.

166
13:24.160 --> 13:25.240
Where are you going?

167
13:25.320 --> 13:26.200
Damn it.

168
13:27.720 --> 13:28.920
That hurt.

169
13:32.320 --> 13:33.520
I never thought

170
13:33.600 --> 13:35.440
you could be such a poisonous snake.

171
13:36.040 --> 13:39.280
I was stupid to underestimate you. But you know what?

172
13:40.440 --> 13:41.360
Now…

173
13:41.440 --> 13:42.680
I'm smarter.

174
13:49.000 --> 13:50.000
Don't!

175
13:50.560 --> 13:52.720
Please let me go.

176
13:52.800 --> 13:55.960
Whatever you want, I'll get it for you.

177
13:56.040 --> 13:58.840
-What? -It hurts.

178
13:58.920 --> 14:00.360
Someone like you?

179
14:00.440 --> 14:01.880
What do you have left?

180
14:01.960 --> 14:03.520
Nothing.

181
14:03.600 --> 14:05.240
What are you going to bargain with?

182
14:05.320 --> 14:08.440
I'll go back to Father. I'll ask him to help me.

183
14:08.520 --> 14:10.440
After everything you've done?

184
14:10.520 --> 14:12.680
You think he'd help you? You idiot!

185
14:15.600 --> 14:16.440
Today…

186
14:17.880 --> 14:19.080
I'm sending you straight to hell.

187
14:19.160 --> 14:20.600
Don't!

188
14:21.320 --> 14:23.080
Huh? Police?

189
14:24.040 --> 14:25.480
Hey!

190
14:25.560 --> 14:27.040
Run!

191
14:27.120 --> 14:28.680
There's no time. Quickly.

192
14:33.880 --> 14:36.800
Liu, Liu, come here.

193
14:36.880 --> 14:38.440
Come on. Get up.

194
14:38.520 --> 14:40.920
-Chamoi, help me. Get up. -Hathai?

195
14:41.000 --> 14:42.080
-Hurry. -Come on.

196
14:42.160 --> 14:43.520
Sit over there.

197
14:44.280 --> 14:45.680
Careful.

198
14:46.560 --> 14:48.880
Chamoi, call an ambulance.

199
14:50.240 --> 14:51.960
Why did you help me?

200
14:52.640 --> 14:54.360
I may not be a good person,

201
14:54.960 --> 14:56.840
but I'm not evil enough

202
14:56.920 --> 14:58.920
to kick someone when they're about to die.

203
15:02.240 --> 15:03.880
Even though

204
15:03.960 --> 15:06.240
I really did want you dead

205
15:06.760 --> 15:08.400
after everything you did to me.

206
15:15.120 --> 15:19.520
Someone like you deserves to pay for everything you've done.

207
15:19.600 --> 15:21.040
And the reason I came here

208
15:21.120 --> 15:24.080
was to have the police drag Pong off to prison.

209
15:27.000 --> 15:28.400
I'm sorry.

210
15:29.480 --> 15:30.960
I was wrong.

211
15:31.040 --> 15:34.360
If you want to kill me, I wouldn't blame you.

212
15:34.960 --> 15:36.560
The truth is

213
15:36.640 --> 15:39.040
I could kill you right here.

214
15:39.960 --> 15:43.720
Then I could tell the police Pong did it.

215
15:45.320 --> 15:46.720
And I'm sure

216
15:46.800 --> 15:49.720
Chamoi would back me up.

217
15:54.160 --> 15:55.200
But I won't.

218
15:58.920 --> 16:00.720
Because I made a promise to my daughter

219
16:02.120 --> 16:04.320
and to my mother's spirit.

220
16:07.560 --> 16:09.560
I'm going to become a better person.

221
16:13.320 --> 16:15.760
I'm not creating any more bad karma with anyone.

222
16:20.000 --> 16:21.760
And I'm giving you a chance

223
16:23.840 --> 16:25.280
the same way Hathaya

224
16:27.000 --> 16:28.600
and everyone else gave me one.

225
16:36.880 --> 16:38.240
Hathai.

226
16:41.160 --> 16:42.080
I…

227
16:42.680 --> 16:44.240
Thank you.

228
16:44.920 --> 16:47.240
Thank you so much.

229
16:49.560 --> 16:51.240
I'm sorry.

230
17:07.839 --> 17:10.160
Father, I need to speak to you.

231
17:11.760 --> 17:14.359
Ramil, call the police and have her arrested.

232
17:15.000 --> 17:15.839
Yes, sir.

233
17:16.359 --> 17:18.359
Hathaya, take me back to rest.

234
17:18.440 --> 17:19.680
Father.

235
17:28.079 --> 17:29.240
Father.

236
17:30.080 --> 17:31.800
I was wrong.

237
17:32.400 --> 17:34.880
If you call the police and have me arrested,

238
17:34.960 --> 17:36.360
I'll accept it.

239
17:36.440 --> 17:37.800
But please

240
17:38.800 --> 17:40.800
help your granddaughter.

241
17:41.600 --> 17:43.800
You want me to help an ungrateful granddaughter?

242
17:43.880 --> 17:46.160
A murderer who tried to kill me?

243
17:47.360 --> 17:50.960
Chayanee did what she did because Chayanee lost control.

244
17:51.040 --> 17:52.560
She felt like she had no choice.

245
17:54.080 --> 17:56.120
If you claim Chayanee lost control,

246
17:56.720 --> 17:58.720
then where is she? Why didn't she come with you?

247
17:59.400 --> 18:01.920
She's hiding.

248
18:02.760 --> 18:05.000
I came to beg you.

249
18:07.680 --> 18:11.280
You're the only person who can help us.

250
18:12.520 --> 18:16.240
Father, Chayanee

251
18:16.320 --> 18:18.720
is your own blood.

252
18:19.400 --> 18:21.280
Please forgive her.

253
18:22.520 --> 18:24.520
Chayanee is my own blood.

254
18:25.040 --> 18:27.600
And yet she tried to kill me twice.

255
18:28.720 --> 18:31.480
Meanwhile, you called everyone else parasites.

256
18:32.080 --> 18:34.320
But those people loved me and helped me.

257
18:36.440 --> 18:37.800
Father.

258
18:40.480 --> 18:42.560
You can blame me.

259
18:42.640 --> 18:44.320
Blame Chayanee.

260
18:44.960 --> 18:46.680
I'll accept that.

261
18:48.080 --> 18:50.760
But please help her first

262
18:50.840 --> 18:53.360
before she does something even worse.

263
18:53.440 --> 18:55.040
Please, Father.

264
18:56.360 --> 18:57.360
Father…

265
18:58.840 --> 19:02.400
Liu, where is Chayanee?

266
19:06.440 --> 19:07.680
She is…

267
19:08.280 --> 19:10.640
planning to have Saksit help her escape

268
19:10.720 --> 19:13.760
even though she has no money to pay him.

269
19:15.320 --> 19:18.600
I'm afraid Saksit will kill her.

270
19:19.720 --> 19:20.720
Grandpa.

271
19:22.560 --> 19:25.440
Please let us go help Chayanee.

272
19:26.280 --> 19:28.560
I'll talk to her and convince her to turn herself in.

273
19:31.680 --> 19:34.960
Go and bring Chayanee to me.

274
19:36.120 --> 19:38.080
If she truly regrets what she's done,

275
19:38.840 --> 19:40.200
I'll help make things easier.

276
19:42.760 --> 19:43.760
Father…

277
19:47.680 --> 19:48.800
Father.

278
19:59.640 --> 20:00.960
Father.

279
20:02.520 --> 20:05.360
Thank you so much

280
20:06.960 --> 20:09.000
for showing mercy to your granddaughter.

281
20:13.680 --> 20:17.280
Liu, can you take us to Chayanee?

282
20:22.680 --> 20:25.320
-Chayanee? -Chayanee?

283
20:28.240 --> 20:31.680
She's not here. Maybe she went out to buy something.

284
20:32.920 --> 20:33.960
Let's wait downstairs.

285
20:40.680 --> 20:41.520
Liu.

286
20:41.600 --> 20:43.240
Could you call her again?

287
20:43.320 --> 20:45.960
But don't tell her you're with us. Or she won't come back.

288
20:46.040 --> 20:48.040
Okay. I'll call her.

289
20:54.040 --> 20:54.920
She picked up.

290
20:56.680 --> 20:58.600
Sweetheart, where are you?

291
20:58.680 --> 21:01.240
I went out to buy something. Where were you?

292
21:01.320 --> 21:05.320
I came out to get you some food. Where are you?

293
21:05.400 --> 21:06.920
Come back to the room.

294
21:08.320 --> 21:10.120
Who are you with?

295
21:14.120 --> 21:15.440
I'm alone.

296
21:16.520 --> 21:19.840
Liar. You brought them here to arrest me.

297
21:23.560 --> 21:26.600
Chayanee, listen to me.

298
21:27.240 --> 21:30.120
I'm not going to prison and letting those people spit in my face.

299
21:31.400 --> 21:33.120
Chayanee, listen.

300
21:33.200 --> 21:36.520
I talked to Grandpa. He said he would--

301
21:38.080 --> 21:38.920
Liu, move!

302
21:41.360 --> 21:42.720
Chayanee, come back!

303
21:42.800 --> 21:44.800
-Grandpa is going to help you. -Chayanee.

304
21:45.360 --> 21:47.320
Chayanee. Hello?

305
21:47.400 --> 21:48.920
Chayanee, come back.

306
21:49.000 --> 21:50.640
-Grandpa is going to help you. -Chayanee

307
21:50.720 --> 21:51.880
No…

308
21:52.400 --> 21:54.320
She turned off her phone.

309
22:06.080 --> 22:08.800
What is this? You want me to help you escape?

310
22:12.040 --> 22:12.960
Where's the money?

311
22:14.200 --> 22:17.280
Before you ask me about money, how are you going to escape?

312
22:17.360 --> 22:18.640
You can't even save yourself.

313
22:18.720 --> 22:20.560
Me? Do you really think that?

314
22:20.640 --> 22:22.560
I have plenty of connections.

315
22:24.360 --> 22:26.000
Pong? You're still alive?

316
22:27.840 --> 22:31.720
Someone like me? Even the Grim Reaper doesn't dare take me.

317
22:32.720 --> 22:35.400
Your mother was very lucky. She got away.

318
22:35.480 --> 22:36.920
What did you do to my mother?

319
22:37.000 --> 22:39.400
I was going to kill her.

320
22:39.480 --> 22:42.760
But the police showed up, so she got away.

321
22:44.440 --> 22:47.120
That's fine. Because today I'm killing you instead.

322
22:48.120 --> 22:49.160
Come closer if you dare.

323
22:51.120 --> 22:54.040
Enough. Put the guns down.

324
22:54.120 --> 22:57.000
If you don't want to die, stop fighting each other.

325
22:57.600 --> 22:59.680
Pong…

326
22:59.760 --> 23:02.640
has people near the border.

327
23:02.720 --> 23:04.840
He's going to get us out.

328
23:04.920 --> 23:06.800
Someone like her?

329
23:07.920 --> 23:11.520
This spoiled little brat has nothing left. She can't afford to pay us.

330
23:15.640 --> 23:17.720
You don't have the money? You lied to me?

331
23:17.800 --> 23:19.600
I have a way to get it.

332
23:19.680 --> 23:20.640
What?

333
23:20.720 --> 23:22.880
Kidnap Grandpa and demand ransom.

334
23:22.960 --> 23:25.480
Hathaya will do anything to keep her Grandpa alive.

335
23:25.560 --> 23:28.840
Think about it. You'll get the money

336
23:28.920 --> 23:31.200
and you'll end the lives of those parasites too.

337
23:36.200 --> 23:37.280
Ramil.

338
23:39.560 --> 23:40.520
Fine.

339
23:41.720 --> 23:44.920
Pong, get your men ready.

340
23:46.480 --> 23:48.120
Before we leave,

341
23:51.200 --> 23:53.720
I want to settle the score

342
23:53.800 --> 23:55.800
with all of them properly.

343
23:59.200 --> 24:01.000
MODEL HOME

344
24:01.080 --> 24:04.080
-This way, Grandpa. -Sir.

345
24:04.600 --> 24:07.520
On behalf of everyone here,

346
24:08.320 --> 24:11.200
thank you for trusting us to build your dream community.

347
24:11.280 --> 24:12.280
Thank you very much.

348
24:13.160 --> 24:14.920
Thank you.

349
24:16.000 --> 24:18.200
Welcome home, sir.

350
24:20.760 --> 24:22.720
Thank you. Thank you, everyone.

351
24:23.880 --> 24:26.520
Thank you for giving us this opportunity.

352
24:27.120 --> 24:30.160
Without you, we'd still be wandering around.

353
24:39.280 --> 24:40.440
Sir.

354
24:47.280 --> 24:50.360
I'm the one who should thank all of you.

355
24:50.440 --> 24:52.240
Hooray!

356
24:52.320 --> 24:53.520
Thank you.

357
24:53.600 --> 24:55.120
Thank you.

358
24:56.960 --> 24:57.960
This way, sir.

359
24:58.040 --> 24:59.960
I'll show you inside.

360
25:00.040 --> 25:01.840
I'll take Grandpa.

361
25:01.920 --> 25:06.120
I ordered lots of food and desserts for the workers.

362
25:07.080 --> 25:10.080
You should help take care of them. I can look around myself.

363
25:10.920 --> 25:12.320
-Go ahead. -Okay.

364
25:12.400 --> 25:16.200
MODEL HOME

365
25:20.240 --> 25:23.200
Hathaya, go take care of the workers.

366
25:23.720 --> 25:24.920
I'll look after Grandpa.

367
25:28.920 --> 25:30.000
Come on.

368
25:38.480 --> 25:39.360
Wait.

369
25:39.440 --> 25:40.600
Yes?

370
25:40.680 --> 25:43.440
Before you go, can I ask you something?

371
25:43.520 --> 25:44.680
What?

372
25:45.680 --> 25:48.120
What did Nuchwara say to you?

373
25:49.840 --> 25:51.040
You want to know?

374
25:53.240 --> 25:54.280
I'm not telling you.

375
25:56.880 --> 25:58.200
Come on. Your mom's calling.

376
25:58.960 --> 26:00.040
Come on.

377
26:01.960 --> 26:03.720
Isn't the house beautiful, Father?

378
26:04.360 --> 26:05.200
Yes.

379
26:05.720 --> 26:08.760
It looks good. Very tasteful. Very neat.

380
26:12.920 --> 26:14.400
Pong.

381
26:15.880 --> 26:17.720
Father, let's go.

382
26:23.160 --> 26:25.520
What are you doing?

383
26:29.000 --> 26:31.000
Grandpa still hasn't come outside to eat.

384
26:31.080 --> 26:32.880
He must really like the house you built.

385
26:39.280 --> 26:40.520
Chayanee.

386
26:40.600 --> 26:41.960
Where's Mr. Pichai?

387
26:42.680 --> 26:43.840
Where's Hathai?

388
26:43.920 --> 26:45.360
They're not dead yet.

389
26:45.440 --> 26:46.960
Chayanee.

390
26:47.040 --> 26:48.880
Where did you take Grandpa and my mom?

391
26:48.960 --> 26:50.640
-Tell me. -Stay back!

392
26:50.720 --> 26:51.560
Hathaya.

393
26:51.640 --> 26:54.240
As long as I'm still here,

394
26:54.920 --> 26:57.360
Grandpa and your mom aren't safe.

395
26:57.960 --> 26:59.120
What do you want?

396
26:59.200 --> 27:00.920
One hundred million.

397
27:02.080 --> 27:04.360
And everything in the safe. Bring it all to me.

398
27:04.440 --> 27:07.160
Chayanee, I don't have that much money.

399
27:07.760 --> 27:08.960
I know

400
27:09.040 --> 27:11.560
Grandpa left everything to you.

401
27:11.640 --> 27:14.040
If you don't want their bodies delivered back to you,

402
27:15.400 --> 27:16.840
bring me what I asked for.

403
27:18.520 --> 27:20.720
I'll send you the location.

404
27:32.440 --> 27:33.480
Ramil.

405
27:34.840 --> 27:36.520
I'm worried about Mom and Grandpa.

406
27:37.160 --> 27:39.360
What do we do?

407
27:40.400 --> 27:41.400
We…

408
27:42.840 --> 27:44.200
We give Chayanee the money.

409
28:00.680 --> 28:01.560
Thank you.

410
28:05.080 --> 28:06.880
Chayanee sent the location.

411
28:08.240 --> 28:09.120
This is…

412
28:09.200 --> 28:10.280
Let's hurry.

413
28:15.320 --> 28:18.360
Madam, where are you going?

414
28:19.120 --> 28:20.360
I'm not running away.

415
28:21.120 --> 28:24.080
I saw Hathaya and Ramil come in and then rush back out.

416
28:24.680 --> 28:25.960
I peeked in.

417
28:26.040 --> 28:29.320
Miss Hathaya opened the safe.

418
28:29.400 --> 28:32.160
Something bad must have happened.

419
28:32.240 --> 28:34.640
Chamoi, let's go to the development.

420
28:37.200 --> 28:38.280
Okay.

421
28:38.880 --> 28:39.960
Everyone.

422
28:40.960 --> 28:44.440
I heard Mr. Pichai and Ms. Hathai

423
28:45.080 --> 28:46.440
were kidnapped for ransom.

424
28:46.520 --> 28:47.920
-What? -What?

425
28:48.000 --> 28:49.840
I knew something was wrong.

426
28:50.480 --> 28:51.640
We have to save Mr. Pichai.

427
28:51.720 --> 28:53.480
Whatever you guys decide, I'm in.

428
28:53.560 --> 28:54.400
-I'm in. -Yes.

429
28:54.480 --> 28:55.320
-Okay? -Yes.

430
28:55.400 --> 28:57.360
-Come on. -Let's go.

431
28:57.440 --> 28:58.560
What's going on?

432
28:58.640 --> 28:59.480
Sorry.

433
29:01.360 --> 29:02.680
Let's eat.

434
29:02.760 --> 29:04.920
Nothing.

435
29:05.440 --> 29:06.960
-Keep eating. -Hey!

436
29:07.480 --> 29:08.480
Don't lie.

437
29:09.160 --> 29:11.720
I heard Mr. Pichai and Hathai

438
29:11.800 --> 29:14.000
were kidnapped for ransom. Who took them?

439
29:17.480 --> 29:18.520
I don't know.

440
29:18.600 --> 29:21.160
I just overheard Chayanee talking to Boss.

441
29:22.400 --> 29:24.880
There. Ramil's back.

442
29:27.560 --> 29:28.800
The workers' quarters.

443
29:35.280 --> 29:36.600
Saksit.

444
29:37.920 --> 29:40.120
You refused to give me money when I asked.

445
29:41.480 --> 29:43.440
So I had to do things this way.

446
29:43.520 --> 29:46.960
I was right not to support a corrupt politician like you.

447
29:47.040 --> 29:50.680
You might want to save some of that

448
29:51.280 --> 29:52.720
self-righteousness

449
29:52.800 --> 29:55.960
for your beloved granddaughter.

450
30:02.920 --> 30:03.920
Chayanee.

451
30:04.640 --> 30:06.320
How could you do this? Stop.

452
30:06.960 --> 30:08.480
You've caused enough trouble.

453
30:08.560 --> 30:10.720
This sounds like a family matter.

454
30:11.360 --> 30:14.560
Nothing to do with us. Let's go.

455
30:28.720 --> 30:32.000
Chayanee says to leave the bag out front

456
30:32.080 --> 30:34.080
and go inside to get Grandpa and Mom.

457
30:35.880 --> 30:37.360
Chayanee.

458
30:37.440 --> 30:39.960
Stop this. You've caused enough trouble.

459
30:40.040 --> 30:42.080
It's too late, Grandpa.

460
30:42.680 --> 30:44.360
It's never too late.

461
30:45.160 --> 30:47.040
If you truly want to change,

462
30:47.560 --> 30:49.320
I'll help lighten the consequences.

463
30:50.040 --> 30:51.160
And then what?

464
30:52.480 --> 30:55.760
I'll still go to prison. I can't live with that, Grandpa.

465
30:55.840 --> 30:57.320
I'd rather kill myself.

466
30:57.920 --> 30:58.760
Chayanee.

467
31:00.480 --> 31:01.920
If I ever hurt you

468
31:03.600 --> 31:06.320
or disappointed you, punish me.

469
31:06.840 --> 31:07.800
Let everyone else go.

470
31:08.560 --> 31:09.600
No.

471
31:13.360 --> 31:15.040
Hathaya has to die

472
31:16.880 --> 31:18.120
before I can be happy.

473
31:18.200 --> 31:21.240
No. Don't hurt my daughter.

474
31:32.560 --> 31:33.520
They tricked us.

475
31:37.200 --> 31:38.440
-Hey! -Open the door.

476
31:40.200 --> 31:43.360
-Let us out! -Pong, let us out! Saksit!

477
31:45.040 --> 31:46.480
We can leave now.

478
31:46.560 --> 31:47.920
What about them?

479
31:48.000 --> 31:51.760
Those parasites will be heading to hell soon enough.

480
31:54.120 --> 31:55.080
The roof too.

481
31:55.160 --> 31:56.240
Keep going.

482
31:56.320 --> 31:57.440
Pong! Saksit!

483
31:57.520 --> 32:00.400
Today I'm sending you back where you belong.

484
32:00.480 --> 32:01.840
You bastard!

485
32:16.240 --> 32:17.280
Hey.

486
32:23.320 --> 32:24.840
I have to go now.

487
32:25.960 --> 32:27.840
I'll say goodbye to you here, Grandpa.

488
32:29.320 --> 32:30.880
No, Chayanee.

489
32:30.960 --> 32:33.680
Let me go. I need to save my daughter.

490
32:33.760 --> 32:35.000
Untie me right now.

491
32:35.760 --> 32:37.200
By now, your daughter

492
32:37.960 --> 32:39.280
has probably burned to death.

493
32:40.440 --> 32:44.000
And soon the fire will spread here too.

494
32:45.480 --> 32:48.000
Then you can take care of your daughter in your next life.

495
32:48.080 --> 32:51.440
No. Let me go. Let me go right now!

496
32:52.040 --> 32:53.160
Chayanee.

497
32:54.080 --> 32:55.880
You can't escape the karma.

498
32:57.600 --> 32:58.760
No…

499
33:03.280 --> 33:05.160
Boss, aren't we waiting for Chayanee?

500
33:05.240 --> 33:08.960
Why would I? I nearly bled myself dry getting this money.

501
33:09.040 --> 33:10.800
I'm not sharing it with anyone.

502
33:10.880 --> 33:12.480
What are you saying?

503
33:17.840 --> 33:19.040
You're helping me.

504
33:20.440 --> 33:22.360
I'll give you Pong's entire share.

505
33:31.960 --> 33:33.360
Wait for me!

506
33:38.240 --> 33:40.680
-Ramil. -Come here.

507
33:43.920 --> 33:45.600
Hathaya. Are you okay?

508
33:47.240 --> 33:50.360
Let me out! I need to save my daughter.

509
33:50.440 --> 33:53.600
Help! Someone help us!

510
33:58.440 --> 33:59.360
Someone help us!

511
33:59.440 --> 34:00.400
That's Hathai's voice.

512
34:00.480 --> 34:01.640
-Hurry. -Help us!

513
34:01.720 --> 34:02.840
-Mr. Pichai's there! -Hurry.

514
34:02.920 --> 34:03.920
-Come on. -There!

515
34:04.000 --> 34:05.720
Go, go!

516
34:05.800 --> 34:06.800
Help!

517
34:06.880 --> 34:08.719
-Help me! -There!

518
34:08.800 --> 34:09.800
-Father! -Liu!

519
34:09.880 --> 34:12.480
Liu. Help me. Untie me.

520
34:12.560 --> 34:14.199
-Help me. I need to help Hathaya. -Help me, quickly!

521
34:18.800 --> 34:20.239
Father.

522
34:20.320 --> 34:21.480
Father.

523
34:21.560 --> 34:23.080
I need to go.

524
34:23.159 --> 34:24.199
Father.

525
34:24.280 --> 34:26.600
Go. Quickly.

526
34:27.840 --> 34:28.920
Watch your head.

527
34:29.000 --> 34:30.400
-Hathaya, are you okay? -Boss.

528
34:30.480 --> 34:32.120
Check on Mom and Grandpa.

529
34:32.639 --> 34:34.320
Your grandpa and Hathai are safe.

530
34:36.719 --> 34:38.440
-Hathaya. -Grandpa.

531
34:38.520 --> 34:39.880
Hathaya…

532
34:44.040 --> 34:45.239
Where's Chayanee?

533
34:46.280 --> 34:48.920
Chayanee, Pong, and Saksit kidnapped us.

534
34:49.000 --> 34:50.400
But they're gone now.

535
34:51.000 --> 34:52.080
I'm calling the police.

536
34:52.960 --> 34:55.360
I already did. They won't get away with this.

537
34:58.800 --> 35:00.760
My people at the border are ready, Boss.

538
35:01.360 --> 35:03.360
Once we get there, we can cross immediately.

539
35:04.440 --> 35:05.320
Good.

540
35:09.360 --> 35:10.680
Chayanee.

541
35:29.640 --> 35:31.440
-You were going to abandon me. -Chayanee.

542
35:31.520 --> 35:32.920
I'll get you out.

543
35:34.000 --> 35:36.240
Here's the money. Take it.

544
35:37.080 --> 35:38.520
Chayanee.

545
35:38.600 --> 35:41.120
-Chayanee. -I'm not stupid.

546
35:41.720 --> 35:42.760
Chayanee, wait!

547
35:43.280 --> 35:44.520
No!

548
36:00.480 --> 36:03.600
Chayanee. Enough, sweetheart.

549
36:03.680 --> 36:05.000
Stop.

550
36:05.680 --> 36:07.560
I'll find a way to help you.

551
36:09.720 --> 36:12.680
-No one can help me now. -Chayanee.

552
36:14.840 --> 36:16.160
Turn yourself in.

553
36:16.800 --> 36:18.160
Chayanee.

554
36:18.840 --> 36:21.320
Everyone loves you and is worried about you.

555
36:22.880 --> 36:26.080
Admit what you did. You still have a chance to live your life.

556
36:26.760 --> 36:28.760
No matter how terrible things get,

557
36:28.840 --> 36:31.280
there is always a way out.

558
36:33.960 --> 36:35.440
There's always a way out.

559
36:36.760 --> 36:37.640
Yes.

560
36:38.480 --> 36:39.880
There is.

561
36:44.800 --> 36:46.200
And my way out is…

562
36:46.920 --> 36:49.400
Don't, Chayanee. Don't. Don't.

563
36:50.040 --> 36:51.560
Don't, Chayanee.

564
36:53.480 --> 36:55.280
No… Chayanee.

565
37:09.720 --> 37:12.640
-Don't. -Chayanee.

566
37:15.640 --> 37:17.160
-My girl! -Miss Chayanee!

567
37:22.240 --> 37:23.480
Chayanee.

568
37:32.800 --> 37:34.400
No!

569
37:36.880 --> 37:38.240
Chayanee.

570
37:39.520 --> 37:40.520
Chayanee.

571
37:42.400 --> 37:43.920
I'm sorry.

572
37:46.440 --> 37:47.720
This is my fault.

573
37:54.560 --> 37:56.760
Chayanee…

574
38:00.760 --> 38:02.520
After that,

575
38:03.600 --> 38:05.600
Raiwin turned himself in.

576
38:07.320 --> 38:09.000
Besides confessing to his own crimes,

577
38:09.680 --> 38:10.680
he told the police

578
38:10.760 --> 38:13.840
about all the corruption cases he'd been involved in

579
38:14.360 --> 38:16.520
and implicated other people too.

580
38:17.560 --> 38:18.920
It became

581
38:20.120 --> 38:22.120
major news for quite a while, Grandma.

582
38:24.720 --> 38:27.480
Even after Raiwin went to prison,

583
38:30.680 --> 38:32.600
there were still a lot of people

584
38:34.080 --> 38:37.280
who admired him for finally having the courage to tell the truth.

585
38:41.040 --> 38:42.880
Sometimes I think about it, Grandma.

586
38:43.920 --> 38:45.920
If Saksit had listened

587
38:47.120 --> 38:48.920
to his son just a little more,

588
38:50.120 --> 38:51.880
or if Raiwin

589
38:52.960 --> 38:55.360
had stood by his own beliefs more firmly,

590
38:56.200 --> 38:58.240
someone like Raiwin

591
38:58.320 --> 39:01.480
might have become a national-level politician.

592
39:04.480 --> 39:05.920
As for Ramil,

593
39:06.000 --> 39:08.240
he moved out of here some time ago.

594
39:10.400 --> 39:12.680
He took Aunt Sanguansri with him.

595
39:14.640 --> 39:17.240
They moved into the house Uncle Anon bought for them.

596
39:20.560 --> 39:21.880
Uncle Anon…

597
39:23.440 --> 39:24.840
tried…

598
39:25.720 --> 39:27.640
and failed so many times…

599
39:29.080 --> 39:31.440
because he thought what mattered was buying a big house.

600
39:32.960 --> 39:34.200
But I think

601
39:35.280 --> 39:37.120
it doesn't matter where we live.

602
39:38.160 --> 39:40.440
If the people we love are together,

603
39:41.800 --> 39:42.640
that's what makes

604
39:43.640 --> 39:45.320
a real home.

605
39:47.360 --> 39:50.080
And that's what Ramil wanted all along.

606
39:51.880 --> 39:54.560
Grandpa is still sad sometimes, Grandma.

607
39:55.880 --> 39:57.320
But my mom

608
39:58.000 --> 40:00.280
is always there taking care of him.

609
40:01.720 --> 40:03.360
And Papang is here too.

610
40:04.800 --> 40:06.800
Papang goes back and forth

611
40:07.600 --> 40:09.800
between this house and Ramil's house.

612
40:11.080 --> 40:12.920
Papang says he likes staying with Great-Grandpa.

613
40:14.880 --> 40:17.520
And even though he never says it,

614
40:19.160 --> 40:20.760
I can tell

615
40:21.800 --> 40:25.360
he's getting more and more attached to me too.

616
40:29.000 --> 40:30.840
It makes me think

617
40:32.400 --> 40:35.040
about how love and hate

618
40:36.920 --> 40:38.320
can change.

619
40:40.400 --> 40:42.840
Just like Papang opened his heart to me.

620
40:44.200 --> 40:46.040
Just like Grandpa and Mom

621
40:46.920 --> 40:49.000
opened their hearts and listened to each other.

622
40:50.640 --> 40:52.760
Grandma, you know,

623
40:52.840 --> 40:54.720
Grandpa and Mom are so close now.

624
40:55.480 --> 40:57.560
They go everywhere together.

625
41:00.000 --> 41:01.240
So…

626
41:04.320 --> 41:06.280
you don't need to worry about us anymore.

627
41:07.880 --> 41:10.880
I'll bring you lots more fun stories

628
41:12.320 --> 41:14.160
another time.

629
41:17.280 --> 41:19.440
But don't worry. It won't be anytime soon.

630
41:20.800 --> 41:22.320
You'll have to wait.

631
41:30.320 --> 41:32.840
As for Aunt Liu…

632
41:37.600 --> 41:40.160
Chayanee, after you…

633
41:44.480 --> 41:45.960
left us…

634
41:51.000 --> 41:52.560
Aunt Liu was arrested.

635
41:53.520 --> 41:55.400
The evidence against her was overwhelming.

636
41:58.160 --> 42:00.360
But even without it,

637
42:04.120 --> 42:07.880
I don't think she had the strength left to fight anymore.

638
42:10.320 --> 42:12.760
After everything that happened,

639
42:14.440 --> 42:16.560
everyone in the family agreed

640
42:19.240 --> 42:21.760
that she had already lost more than enough.

641
42:24.440 --> 42:27.480
It was probably more than anyone could bear.

642
42:32.760 --> 42:34.600
When she finishes serving her sentence,

643
42:35.920 --> 42:39.720
everyone here will still welcome her home.

644
42:42.480 --> 42:44.240
So don't worry, Chayanee.

645
42:56.360 --> 42:57.320
And…

646
43:00.200 --> 43:02.760
what I regret most…

647
43:07.520 --> 43:09.520
is that I never got the chance

648
43:10.320 --> 43:13.440
to make things right with you.

649
43:21.520 --> 43:25.360
I still remember when we were little.

650
43:27.680 --> 43:30.640
You and I were so close.

651
43:35.040 --> 43:37.320
But everything that happened,

652
43:38.480 --> 43:39.720
I know

653
43:40.320 --> 43:42.720
it didn't begin with the two of us.

654
43:44.560 --> 43:46.600
And I still don't understand

655
43:48.840 --> 43:52.240
how we ended up fighting until everything went so far.

656
44:05.520 --> 44:07.880
If I could change anything,

657
44:11.600 --> 44:14.840
I would try harder to talk to you.

658
44:16.800 --> 44:18.400
I'm sorry…

659
44:21.160 --> 44:23.320
I wasn't good enough.

660
44:27.560 --> 44:29.280
I'm sorry.

661
44:33.240 --> 44:34.760
I played a part

662
44:35.880 --> 44:40.040
in making you choose what you did.

663
44:49.760 --> 44:51.400
I truly am sorry.

664
44:56.440 --> 44:58.800
And if there really is another life,

665
45:01.000 --> 45:03.640
I hope we meet again.

666
45:06.360 --> 45:08.880
You can be my little sister again.

667
45:12.440 --> 45:14.760
You don't have to worry anymore, Chayanee.

668
45:29.120 --> 45:30.440
Grandpa.

669
45:31.440 --> 45:34.120
I'm going to visit Aunt Liu. Anything you want me to tell her?

670
45:34.200 --> 45:35.200
Hm.

671
45:36.040 --> 45:39.480
Tell her to take care of herself. And not to dwell on everything too much.

672
45:40.680 --> 45:41.960
And tell her that

673
45:42.040 --> 45:44.080
when she finishes her sentence,

674
45:44.160 --> 45:46.280
we can all be together again.

675
45:48.640 --> 45:50.720
And visit Raiwin for me too.

676
45:51.360 --> 45:54.280
Okay. Actually,

677
45:54.360 --> 45:56.680
I just visited him a few days ago.

678
45:58.000 --> 46:00.240
He's doing well mentally

679
46:00.320 --> 46:02.520
and helping with work in prison.

680
46:02.600 --> 46:04.920
I believe he'll be released before too long.

681
46:07.720 --> 46:09.480
Mr. Pichai, sir!

682
46:10.480 --> 46:11.800
You scared me.

683
46:11.880 --> 46:13.920
That voice could shatter glass.

684
46:14.000 --> 46:15.840
Maybe I should send you to construction work.

685
46:15.920 --> 46:17.600
No, sir.

686
46:18.720 --> 46:23.200
Sir, there's a very special guest here to see you.

687
46:23.800 --> 46:25.920
Who? How special could they be?

688
46:30.240 --> 46:32.920
-Papang. -Hello.

689
46:33.680 --> 46:36.800
How are you? How's the new house your father bought for you?

690
46:36.880 --> 46:39.400
It's beautiful. And I sleep very well there.

691
46:40.120 --> 46:41.960
Of course he does, Father.

692
46:42.040 --> 46:44.600
There's no Chamoi screeching to hurt his ears.

693
46:44.680 --> 46:45.640
Right.

694
46:47.560 --> 46:50.400
Mr. Pichai, I came to discuss something with you.

695
46:50.480 --> 46:52.720
I'd like to formally ask

696
46:52.800 --> 46:57.000
for your granddaughter's hand in marriage for my son.

697
47:00.000 --> 47:01.760
What do you think?

698
47:01.840 --> 47:05.440
And how does your son feel about my granddaughter?

699
47:07.320 --> 47:10.440
Do I really have to say it out loud, sir?

700
47:10.520 --> 47:11.800
I can get embarrassed too.

701
47:11.880 --> 47:14.120
I think you've already seen

702
47:14.200 --> 47:16.920
how much I love

703
47:17.000 --> 47:19.560
and care about your granddaughter.

704
47:19.640 --> 47:20.840
I know.

705
47:21.400 --> 47:25.240
Then I hope you have no objection to us formally asking for her hand.

706
47:27.400 --> 47:28.360
Great-Grandpa.

707
47:28.440 --> 47:29.440
Yes?

708
47:30.040 --> 47:32.240
I have two daddies.

709
47:32.320 --> 47:33.160
Yes.

710
47:33.240 --> 47:35.640
Daddy Raiwin and Daddy Ramil.

711
47:36.280 --> 47:39.000
But I only have one mommy.

712
47:40.240 --> 47:43.520
I want Mommy Hathaya too.

713
47:44.800 --> 47:46.680
You're so important, right?

714
47:53.320 --> 47:56.720
Come here. Sit with me. Good boy.

715
47:57.320 --> 48:00.760
So you agree, right?

716
48:02.440 --> 48:03.280
No.

717
48:06.440 --> 48:07.720
Why not, sir?

718
48:07.800 --> 48:09.800
Why not, Grandpa?

719
48:10.320 --> 48:13.720
The last time someone came to ask for your granddaughter's hand,

720
48:13.800 --> 48:16.240
you said it should be up to her.

721
48:16.320 --> 48:19.840
Why aren't you asking how I feel this time?

722
48:21.960 --> 48:23.280
Hathaya.

723
48:23.880 --> 48:26.400
You're a woman. Try to hide your excitement a little.

724
48:29.240 --> 48:32.520
I don't want you marrying me off to someone else.

725
48:32.600 --> 48:34.040
Excuse me.

726
48:36.040 --> 48:36.920
Come here.

727
48:37.000 --> 48:39.840
If you don't give us your blessing, I'll just run away with her.

728
48:44.080 --> 48:45.440
You'd really go that far?

729
48:47.720 --> 48:49.800
When I said no,

730
48:49.880 --> 48:53.200
I meant there's no need to waste time with a formal proposal.

731
48:58.400 --> 49:01.280
Everyone already thinks you two

732
49:01.920 --> 49:03.480
are husband and wife anyway.

733
49:03.560 --> 49:05.640
So stop making such a fuss.

734
49:05.720 --> 49:07.640
No elaborate ceremony.

735
49:08.240 --> 49:10.280
Just take my granddaughter to your home

736
49:10.360 --> 49:12.960
and make her happy.

737
49:13.680 --> 49:15.440
Thank you so much, sir.

738
49:16.120 --> 49:17.480
Thank you, Grandpa.

739
49:18.200 --> 49:19.160
Ramil.

740
49:19.720 --> 49:22.080
Stop addressing me like that.

741
49:22.800 --> 49:23.760
Call me something else.

742
49:25.720 --> 49:27.800
Grandpa… Go ahead.

743
49:29.760 --> 49:31.720
Thank you, Grandpa.

744
49:32.560 --> 49:33.760
That's better.

745
49:36.840 --> 49:39.000
I just want to see my granddaughter happy

746
49:39.760 --> 49:41.760
and building a family based on love.

747
49:43.040 --> 49:44.000
I promise.

748
49:44.600 --> 49:47.880
I'll make Hathaya the happiest woman in the world.

749
49:55.840 --> 49:57.480
Hug her. Kiss her.

750
49:57.560 --> 49:59.320
Come on, hug her.

751
49:59.400 --> 50:02.440
-Show some respect in front of Father. -Oh, go ahead.

752
50:02.520 --> 50:03.560
I won't look.

753
50:06.320 --> 50:08.920
Then go ahead and kiss her.

754
50:09.000 --> 50:13.240
-Kiss her. -Kiss her.

755
50:13.320 --> 50:15.200
-Kiss her. -Kiss her.

756
50:15.280 --> 50:17.360
-Kiss her. -Kiss her.

757
50:17.440 --> 50:18.760
All right.

758
50:19.600 --> 50:21.280
Wait!

759
50:21.360 --> 50:23.480
-What now? -Wait.

760
50:23.560 --> 50:25.600
Why? Let me ask you something first.

761
50:26.560 --> 50:27.920
What did Nuchwara say to you?

762
50:28.000 --> 50:30.360
Nuchwara warned me

763
50:30.440 --> 50:31.880
to be careful.

764
50:32.880 --> 50:34.120
You're dangerous.

765
50:37.120 --> 50:38.240
You still love me anyway?

766
50:38.840 --> 50:39.960
Of course I do.

767
51:15.120 --> 51:21.760
THE END

768
52:21.800 --> 52:22.640
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
